Subject: [PATCH 158/167] =?UTF-8?q?hjviewer:=20About=20links=20in=20the=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?system=20browser,=20"=EA=B0=9C=EC=9D=B8=EC=A0=95=EB=B3=B4=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EC=B2=98=EB=A6=AC=EB=B0=A9=EC=B9=A8",=20no=20beta=20mark=20on?=
