MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The About links (the privacy policy and the source code, on the desktop and
on phones) open with LaunchMode.externalApplication: in Safari or the
system browser, never a web view inside the app. The desktop's "Website"
link opened the same repository page as "소스 코드(GNU AGPL-3.0)" and goes;
phones had only the source link. The privacy policy's link is named
"개인정보 처리방침" in Korean (ko.rs "Privacy Statement").

The terminal items of the card menus, the recent sessions' menu and the
session toolbar lose the beta mark: "터미널" and "터미널(관리자 권한)" in
Korean, upstream's "Terminal" and "Terminal (Run as administrator)" without
" (beta)" in English. hjvTerminalBeta and terminalBeta are now
hjvTerminalLabel and terminalLabel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
